HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra0121.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra0122.fits,spectra0123.fits, spectra0124.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0125.fits,spectra0126.fits, spectra0127.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0128.fits,spectra0129.fits, spectra0130.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0131.fits,spectra0132.fits, spectra0133.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0134.fits,spectra0135.fits, spectra0136.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0137.fits,spectra0138.fits, spectra0139.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0140.fits werecombined using a robust weighted mean with         HISTORY a sigma threshold of8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale             HISTORY factors were determinedusing order 1 and are:                           HISTORY 0.8865183730150822, 1.010225853253582,0.8857553130277401,               HISTORY 0.960197588809683, 0.9824950346439004,1.0039230337852227,               HISTORY 0.9754073778731409, 0.996107506978045,1.0105062037689911,               HISTORY 0.982994258563133, 0.9604563552091602,1.1235129732184348,               HISTORY 1.0488579638086968, 1.0673503707011098,0.9818499946732098,              HISTORY 1.1165746930146376, 0.9901256834962887,1.0763021946186218,              HISTORY 1.1031273893649316, 1.2574417342385615.                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             